  "releaseNotes": "## v3.18.10 (patch)\n\nChanges since v3.18.9:\n\n- [patch] Defer Python annotations so a class can name itself or a later class ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- [patch] Move JavaScript initialiser assignments out of GenerateMethod ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- [patch] Call super() first in a JavaScript derived class's constructor ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))",
